  <div class="l-constrain c-paragraph c-paragraph--type-wysiwyg c-paragraph--view-mode-default c-rte">
        




<div  class="c-field c-field--name-field-wysiwyg c-field--type-text-long c-field--label-hidden">
  <div class="c-field__content"><h2>Contact Us</h2><p>For more information on the ADT program, email us at <a href="mailto:traceability@usda.gov"><u>traceability@usda.gov</u></a>. We also encourage you to contact your <a href="https://www.usaha.org/saho"><u>State animal health official</u></a>&nbsp;to learn more about your State's traceability activities and requirements.</p></div></div>

  </div>
      
                            
                
        
